  <text>
    <body>
      <div>
        <head>Introduction</head>
        <p>Opening paragraph with a reference<note place="foot"><p>First footnote of the article.</p></note> and a link to <ref target="https://example.org/reference">an external resource</ref>.</p>
        <p rend="consecutive">A consecutive paragraph continuing the previous one.</p>
        <div>
          <head>State of the Art</head>
          <quote>
            <p>A prose quotation attributed to an earlier author.</p>
          </quote>
          <p>The ordered enumeration follows.</p>
          <list type="decimal" n="1">
            <item>First ordered item<list type="lowerLetter" n="1"><item>Nested ordered item</item></list></item>
            <item>Second ordered item</item>
          </list>
          <p>The unordered enumeration follows.</p>
          <list type="bulleted">
            <item>First bulleted item</item>
            <item>Second bulleted item</item>
          </list>
          <div>
            <head>Method</head>
            <p>Closing paragraph with a second note<note place="foot"><p>Second footnote of the article.</p></note>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
